    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "3. Heard learned counsel for the parties and perused the record.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 815,
      "end": 882,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the applicant would submit that the applicant is not named in the FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 883,
      "end": 973,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20083272457122803
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The co-accused have already been released on anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 974,
      "end": 1037,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4362528920173645
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "The persons from whose custody,\narticles were recovered, they have also been granted regular bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1038,
      "end": 1136,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3877841830253601
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "5. Learned State Counsel would submit that applicants have a long criminal history and they have been absconding.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1138,
      "end": 1251,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20469623804092407
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "6. The bail rejection order reveals that the applicants have been absconding and non bailable warrant as well as the proceeding under Section 82 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973, have Khalid vs State Of Uttarakhand on 11 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/14496056/\n1 been proceeded against them.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1253,
      "end": 1580,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 82",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1387,
          "end": 1397
        },
        {
          "text": "Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1405,
          "end": 1437
        },
        {
          "text": "Khalid vs State Of Uttarakhand",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1444,
          "end": 1474
        },
        {
          "text": "11 December, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1478,
          "end": 1495
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31177690625190735
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Charge-sheet has already been filed against the co-accused, but investigation is still pending against the applicants.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1581,
      "end": 1699,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.328716903924942
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The applicants have been absconding and they are not cooperating in the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1700,
      "end": 1786,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.47933971881866455
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "7. Having considered the entirety of facts, this Court is of the view that there is no reason to grant the anticipatory bail to the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1788,
      "end": 1930,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.333515465259552
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Both the anticipatory bail applications deserve to be rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1931,
      "end": 1994,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5187901854515076
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "8. Both these anticipatory bail applications are rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1996,
      "end": 2054,
